From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LIMInGZE666 <LIMInGZE666@noreply.gitcode.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Oct 2026 22:45:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] OHOS: build a single unversioned shared object

KWaylandClient sets VERSION/SOVERSION upstream, so CMake generates the
versioned chain libKWaylandClient.so -> libKWaylandClient.so.6 ->
libKWaylandClient.so.6.7.2 and calls cmake_symlink_library to create it.
Creating symlinks is not permitted in the OHOS build environment, so the
build fails at the link step:

  CMake Error: failed to create symbolic link
      '../../bin/libKWaylandClient.so.6': Permission denied
  CMake Error: cmake_symlink_library: System Error: Permission denied

Every published OHOS ecosystem library is a single unversioned file
(libKF6Screen.so, libKScreenLocker.so, libkdecorations3private.so), so
drop VERSION/SOVERSION from the target; the artifact then matches the
published shape. The DT_SONAME entry is unaffected: the recipe defines
CMAKE_SHARED_LIBRARY_SONAME_CXX_FLAG, and a device probe confirms the
unversioned library still carries SONAME libKWaylandClient.so, so the
consumers' DT_NEEDED entries stay bare and relocatable (kdecoration
precedent).
---
 src/client/CMakeLists.txt | 14 +++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/client/CMakeLists.txt b/src/client/CMakeLists.txt
index df59c95..8f581bd 100644
--- a/src/client/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/client/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -242,9 +242,17 @@ target_link_libraries(KWaylandClient
         Qt6::WaylandClientPrivate
 )
 
-set_target_properties(KWaylandClient PROPERTIES VERSION   ${KWAYLAND_VERSION}
-                                                 SOVERSION ${KWAYLAND_SOVERSION}
-)
+# OHOS: build one unversioned shared object. KWaylandClient sets
+# VERSION/SOVERSION, so CMake generates the versioned chain
+# libKWaylandClient.so -> libKWaylandClient.so.6 -> libKWaylandClient.so.6.7.2
+# and calls cmake_symlink_library to create it; creating symlinks is not
+# permitted in the OHOS build environment (build fails with "Permission
+# denied"). Every published OHOS ecosystem library is a single unversioned
+# file (libKF6Screen.so, libKScreenLocker.so, libkdecorations3private.so;
+# kdecoration / kscreenlocker precedents). DT_SONAME is unaffected: the
+# recipe still defines CMAKE_SHARED_LIBRARY_SONAME_CXX_FLAG, which keeps
+# the linker recording libKWaylandClient.so as the soname, so consumers
+# keep a bare, relocatable DT_NEEDED entry.
 
 install(TARGETS KWaylandClient EXPORT KWaylandTargets ${KF_INSTALL_TARGETS_DEFAULT_ARGS})
 
